let li=(a,b,c)=>{let d=0;if(a in mi)a=mi[a];if(typeof a=="string"){let c=a,b=parseFloat(c);if(c.endsWith("px"))d=b;else if(c.endsWith("%"))a=b/100;else if(c.endsWith("vw"))d=b/100*document.documentElement.clientWidth;else if(c.endsWith("vh"))d=b/100*document.documentElement.clientHeight;else a=b}if(typeof a=="number")d=b*a;return c+d},mi={start:0,center:.5,end:1};export{li,mi};